# BenchmarkDotNet writes a report set here on every run, including ones from a half-finished experiment.
# Nothing is tracked by default so a casual run never shows up in `git status`; to publish a run worth
# keeping, add the reports you want explicitly:
#
#     git add -f test/LibRed.Benchmarks/Results/results/<suite>-report-github.md
*
!.gitignore
